ready: 1
kind: entity_group
id: memory.data
module: memory
title: Memory data
summary: Memories, their versions, their provenance links, and the change ledger.
entities:
  - memory.data.memory
  - memory.data.memory-version
  - memory.data.memory-link
  - memory.data.memory-change
rationale: >-
  The memory row holds what ranking, decay, and trust need. Versions keep every past content so
  belief history and revision can be shown. Links form the provenance graph that lineage and purge
  walk. The ledger outlives purged memories without their content, so a stack can show that
  something was forgotten and why.
